amic speaker then don't  become envious of those who are and get  more likes yeah you know you could also  apply this to other things if you're  producing very in-depth videos and you  know going deep into texts don't expect  that that's going to get all sorts of  views like much more superficial glitzy  stuff is going to either according to  you know Rand would be instance of  Justice things that are unearned don't  give them to others as well don't give  people handouts don't make things easier  for people that they don't deserve to  have made easy for them that strikes a  lot of people as as quite selfish and  cruel Rand thinks that that's actually  part of justice so all of these virtues  really according to Rand stem from the  virtue of rationality but each one of  them is important in its own right so we  have the three cardinal virtues here of  rationality productiveness and pride and  then  have these other four virtues that each  fit under somehow the rubric of  rationality and these are the ideal  character traits of the good person in  Randian you know egoist ethics  you
 

